{"page":399,"verses":[{"verse_key":"29:24","surah":29,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"فَمَا كَانَ جَوَابَ قَوْمِهِۦٓ إِلَّآ أَن قَالُوا۟ ٱقْتُلُوهُ أَوْ حَرِّقُوهُ فَأَنجَىٰهُ ٱللَّهُ مِنَ ٱلنَّارِ ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّقَوْمٍ يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The only answer Abraham’s people gave was, ‘Kill him or burn him!’ but God saved him from the Fire: there truly are signs in this for people who believe.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَوَابَ","en_gloss":"(the) answer","transliteration":"jawāba","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَوْمِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"(of) his people","transliteration":"qawmihi","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱقْتُلُوهُ","en_gloss":"Kill him","transliteration":"uq'tulūhu","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حَرِّقُوهُ","en_gloss":"burn him","transliteration":"ḥarriqūhu","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَأَنجَىٰهُ","en_gloss":"But Allah saved him","transliteration":"fa-anjāhu","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"But Allah saved him","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the fire","transliteration":"l-nāri","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"29:24"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"